Charon and Cerberus are in monst.c because I had plans for a special
level along those lines.  A ferry boat isn't easy to manage, though,
the nearest thing to one in the code is the vault guard's magic
corridor.  The idea was tabled amid discussions of making it a bridge
instead and other issues.

We'll surely discuss it again for 3.1, which is planned to have more
special levels, including some real lairs for the demon princes in
hell, and some other new diversions like a certain polychromatic
dragon.

As for Cerebus, there are no aardvarks in NetHack, yet.  (Nor samurai
rabbits or teenage mutant ninja turtles.)


